titled (4).png", "id": "1327505929431978", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304305_1327505932765311_5286460740341237931_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XF6HE1KJhncQ7kNvwHoMAz-&_nc_oc=Adp0JZ2F6pym578bh_aK9AvBGReS2E1AbVja3_MfC2NSigxFEEsapScH7C6oYrfINbs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8VoE9kk_dsMC2QSnKjFxW2qbaNRrSaFK4oGVuURrSDEA&oe=6A356B24"}, {"file_name": "Untitled (33).png", "id": "2076724189787348", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304938_2076724193120681_4871879008737988130_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BXq8kPHPcr8Q7kNvwHkBi7u&_nc_oc=Ado8Cg9owVAdfM2N7zHBsVS7HpkdufJ8hjxLaJpBqfM2CLhk2syQ0l5RuWwPXJ7eo0I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8qy-a2yCccDIeVXQF2yKQluAz1F8t5rv_SvUDcXgFMVg&oe=6A354657"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00033.png", "id": "3932380693732122", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304938_3932380697065455_5087597325838508038_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0uraQU6LuZAQ7kNvwFtBOpu&_nc_oc=Adq2pCj_Hi2Qjb7Q5xDB8oRkJEEs6GJzx3dJPEtvGqBEcPeHeucsXfM4-Y4imD1XBhs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_4IgRRquqkC8KEyzebQ4JOXZWwI8OL5l0xWklOko3CkQ&oe=6A355D62"}, {"file_name": "Untitled (34).png", "id": "890620570035576", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_890620573368909_3665044860292886222_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1OvzZklh9G4Q7kNvwFc-Crh&_nc_oc=Adot7LCWWYqAYW4oT8pqReWW9mDeFPdgeVe68vVqYePelVxnSfTXkDFAdiRYzhjHNdo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af84OgaEi8xpnurbY8zcDa5R9dSH1rxSCy3DbaYFVLeaOw&oe=6A35585B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Zbonk_TempleVariant_KeyArt_2560x1440.png", "id": "2158123708319274", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312310_2158123711652607_1528123657011535522_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FmyLvVAHlZMQ7kNvwE6TC2c&_nc_oc=Adp3cY0ZN0TyKruCc61UbYXt6k6olzeoOek_bqAgLPqSAMj_u3mkks-uVUS8IzgO17A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9HlRSaPuKVChW4nmIdRSpk_s01X0wmLrGabNfvpOOyRA&oe=6A356D4E"}, "display_name": "ZOMBONK", "keywords": ["zombie", "gun", "shooting", "multiplayer", "monke"], "long_description": "# Bonker wake up. World gone. Whatever.\n\nZombies and monsters everywhere. Bonker still vibing. \ud83d\ude0e\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\n\nExplore maps, crack open boxes, hunt for gear, survive long enough to flex it.\n\nLoot stuff \u2192 Sell stuff \u2192 Get Bonk$ \u2192 Buy drip. \n\n# Multiple maps to choose from:\n- \ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Bonktopia City - open, quiet, and NOT SAFE\n- \ud83e\udddf Zombie Survival - relentless waves, COD zombies vibes\n- \ud83c\udfeb School - three levels. too many footsteps.\n- \ud83d\udef0\ufe0f Space - out it the orbit, something broke into the station\n- \ud83d\udca3 War - they started it, you end it\n- \ud83d\udc1bNest - what lies underground will shock you\n- \ud83c\udffaTemple - explore the secrets of the civilizations before bonkers\n\n\n     \n\nPro Tip: Bonk with friends for more loot and more BONK$. \n\nPlay in private servers or chill in the Social Hub safe zone to hang with fellow Bonkers.\n\n**\ud83e\udd1d Come hang in discord, and meet our bonker community \ud83d\udc49 discord.gg/zbvr**\n", "short_description": "Survive the zombie apocalypse, loot for guns and items!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Sinn Studio Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/contact", "website_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_cat